# DAXVORA Website — Environment Variables
# Evaluation ID: DAXVORA-RAJAT-2026-08-A01
#
# No environment variables are required for this project.
# All three demos (Halo Agent, Data & Context, Demand-to-Revenue) are
# SIMULATED with client-side state only — no external API calls are made.
#
# The contact form uses a mailto: link. No backend form service credentials
# are needed.
#
# If deploying to a platform that requires a custom NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix
# for the contact email address, you may set:
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_EMAIL=hello@daxvora.com
#
# This is optional — the email is currently hardcoded in app/contact/page.tsx.
